{"index": 46, "skill": "water-quality", "level": "L2", "question": "帮我分析一下最近一个月瘦西湖水质变化趋势。", "expected_sql": "SELECT DATE(d.spt) AS '日期',\n       AVG(d.dox) AS '平均溶解氧(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.codmn) AS '平均CODMn(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.nh3n) AS '平均氨氮(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.tp) AS '平均总磷(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.ph) AS '平均pH',\n       AVG(d.wtmp) AS '平均水温(℃)'\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d d\nJOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b b ON d.stcd = b.stcd\nWHERE b.stnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%' AND b.sttp = 'WQ'\n  AND d.spt >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 1 MONTH)\n  AND d.spt <= NOW()\nGROUP BY DATE(d.spt)\nORDER BY DATE(d.spt);", "final_answer": "## 瘦西湖水质变化趋势分析（2026年7月）\n\n### 综合结论\n\n瘦西湖7月份整体水质稳定，综合评定 **Ⅲ类**，四项核心指标均在Ⅲ类标准范围内，未出现超标或恶化事件。\n\n### 核心指标趋势\n\n![瘦西湖水质指标日变化趋势](瘦西湖水质趋势图.png)\n\n| 指标 | 月均值 | 范围 | 评定 |\n|------|--------|------|------|\n| **溶解氧 DO** | 4.02 mg/L | 3.90 ~ 4.10 | Ⅲ类 ✅ |\n| **高锰酸盐指数 CODMn** | 2.90 mg/L | 2.80 ~ 3.00 | Ⅲ类 ✅ |\n| **氨氮 NH₃-N** | 0.580 mg/L | 0.560 ~ 0.590 | Ⅲ类 ✅ |\n| **总磷 TP** | 0.110 mg/L | 恒定 0.110 | Ⅲ类 ✅ |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n1. **溶解氧偏低需关注** — DO 均值 4.02 mg/L 虽满足Ⅲ类标准（≥3 mg/L），但距Ⅱ类标准（≥5 mg/L）差距较大。夏季高温期藻类耗氧可能进一步压缩溶解氧空间，建议加强水体增氧措施。\n\n2. **指标整体稳定** — 四项指标波动幅度极小（CODMn ±0.1，氨氮 ±0.015），说明流域污染负荷控制有效，水环境管理措施运行平稳。\n\n3. **总磷全月恒定** — TP 始终维持在 0.110 mg/L，可能受面源污染持续输入影响，建议排查入湖支流磷负荷来源。\n\n详细报告已保存至输出目录。", "actual_sqls": ["SELECT COLUMN_NAME, DATA_TYPE, IS_NULLABLE FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS WHERE TABLE_SCHEMA = 'sl325' AND TABLE_NAME = 'wq_pcp_d'", "SELECT MIN(spt) AS min_spt, MAX(spt) AS max_spt FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d", "SELECT stcd, stnm, rvnm, sttp FROM sl323.st_stbprp_b WHERE sttp='WQ' AND (stnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%' OR rvnm LIKE '%瘦西湖%') LIMIT 20", "SELECT MAX(spt) AS latest_spt FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d WHERE stcd = 'HT0051003052000022'", "SELECT\n  DATE(spt) AS dt,\n  COUNT(*) AS sample_cnt,\n  ROUND(AVG(dox), 2) AS avg_dox,\n  ROUND(MIN(dox), 2) AS min_dox,\n  ROUND(MAX(dox), 2) AS max_dox,\n  ROUND(AVG(codmn), 2) AS avg_codmn,\n  ROUND(MIN(codmn), 2) AS min_codmn,\n  ROUND(MAX(codmn), 2) AS max_codmn,\n  ROUND(AVG(nh3n), 3) AS avg_nh3n,\n  ROUND(MIN(nh3n), 3) AS min_nh3n,\n  ROUND(MAX(nh3n), 3) AS max_nh3n,\n  ROUND(AVG(tp), 3) AS avg_tp,\n  ROUND(MIN(tp), 3) AS min_tp,\n  ROUND(MAX(tp), 3) AS max_tp,\n  ROUND(AVG(ph), 2) AS avg_ph,\n  ROUND(AVG(turb), 1) AS avg_turb,\n  ROUND(AVG(wtmp), 1) AS avg_wtmp\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d\nWHERE stcd = 'HT0051003052000022'\n  AND spt >= '2026-07-01' AND spt < '2026-08-01'\nGROUP BY DATE(spt)\nORDER BY dt"], "tool_trace": ["read_file", "read_file", "read_file", "read_file", "ls", "ls", "bash", "bash", "water-db_get_table_schema", "water-db_get_date_range", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "read_file", "read_file", "bash", "bash", "bash", "bash", "bash", "write_file", "write_file", "bash", "write_file", "read_file", "bash", "present_files"], "tool_results": ["Error: [Errno 13] Access denied: path escapes mounted directory: '/mnt/skills/public/water-quality'", "Error: Unsafe absolute paths in command: /mnt/. Use paths under /mnt/user-data", "Table `wq_pcp_d` not found in database `sl323`.", "`wq_pcp_d`: query failed ((1146, \"Table 'sl323.wq_pcp_d' doesn't exist\"))", "[{\"min_spt\": \"2019-01-01 00:00:00\", \"max_spt\": \"2034-12-31 23:00:00\"}]", "[{\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"stcd\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"NO\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"prpnm\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"ltnm\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"spt\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"datetime\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"NO\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"dox\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"codmn\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"codcr\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"bod5\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"wtmp\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NU